## 4. What this index does and does not prove

- It proves *where* a requirement is stated and which test ids appear in
  the same section. It does NOT prove the test exists or passes; that is
  the acceptance suite's job (INDEX §5) and is tagged missing evidence
  until it runs.
- Rows with `—` in the Test ids column are requirements with no test id
  in their own section; they are resolved references, not proven tests.
